  "content": "<p><a href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"A Serilum Mod. Made with love. Lots of active mods for Fabric, Forge and Neo!\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg&w=400\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg&w=400\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg&w=400\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg&w=400\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h2><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"About the mod\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p>Enchanting Commands 是一个极简主义的模组，允许通过命令轻松创建具有超过默认等级的附魔物品。与添加自定义附魔的其他模组兼容。在命令过程中，使用 Tab 键可以自动补全。</p>\n<h2><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"Dependencies\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/collective\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg&w=502\" alt=\"Requires Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/modpack/the-vanilla-experience\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/the-vanilla-experience.svg&w=700\" alt=\"Included in The Vanilla Experience\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/serilums-qol-bundle\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/qol-bundle.svg&w=668\" alt=\"Included in Serilum's QoL Bundle\" width=\"334\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/server.svg&w=440\" alt=\"Environment: Server\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"Configurable\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://serilum.com/configuration-guide\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg&w=440\" alt=\"Configuration guide\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;所有可用的配置选项：</p>\n<details><summary>Show Spoiler</summary>\n<p><span><strong>enchantCommandString</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 \"ec\"<br>此模组功能的默认命令。默认为 /ec。如果与其他模组冲突，可以更改。<br><br></p>\n</details>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"Showcase\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span><strong><em>/ec 命令的基本用法。</em></strong></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/enchanting-commands/a.png\" alt=\"ec\" width=\"752\" height=\"178\"><br><br><span><em><strong>(1.16) 附魔列表。</strong></em></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/enchanting-commands/b.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"752\" height=\"215\"><br><br><em><strong>与其他模组的附魔兼容：</strong><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/enchanting-commands/c.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"832\" height=\"422\"><br><br><strong>将附魔添加到主手物品上。</strong></em><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/enchanting-commands/d.png\" alt=\"ecsharp\" width=\"731\" height=\"134\"><br><br></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/enchanting-commands/e.png\" alt=\"ecsharpsword\" width=\"425\" height=\"178\"><br><br><span><em><strong>附魔也可以添加到“非工具”物品上。</strong></em></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/enchanting-commands/f.png\" alt=\"ecknockback\" width=\"670\" height=\"125\"><br><br></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/enchanting-commands/g.png\" alt=\"ecknockbackstick\" width=\"414\" height=\"100\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"Notes and links\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span><strong>您可以免费将此模组用于任何模组包，只要下载仍然托管在 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生态系统中。</strong></span><br><br><span><a href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Serilum.com</a> 包含所有可用模组的概述和更多信息。</span><br><span><br>对于问题、建议或其他内容，请访问&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\">Github repo</a>。谢谢！</span><span><br><br></span></p>",
